1449", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619145_1482209849624782_2953575631843583094_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u4PH345vdQEQ7kNvwFlLiP7&_nc_oc=AdqPA41F7OutgsbRWRbpqg451fZq_5PLYVaaaU_h59rDE8cyp7T6t1iWtsutJx5W5mk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af78d3xKK67E1qybXK4n28eeAuG3MKdngmAFGlaKIqmYmw&oe=6A09D851"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "1307147150753149", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619681_1307147154086482_3092090264023794624_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=89ebtW53DRMQ7kNvwGGUdBC&_nc_oc=Adphq4hanKEI2KG_7FInP4RyD4MlUeLqmg9ejX1ctr_oc-KoAWlFEC8spaMWNWwxq5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6sARowcxdAcsBXnZVBIIEmzJOwoSsOXBTkB2EnRu6oiA&oe=6A09B351"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "1087082782807722", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618920_1087082789474388_6834342829567925464_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M0QRuLcXgxgQ7kNvwFPWDKg&_nc_oc=Adobd15CeQzza-t0y0DT9L1cSYEgKy1KaEoqxI4KRXJicSiuoGnffxFlo2zilINBJvk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6aslpvnuQH_rxBlVGCndxnvUM0KIaTcq1RiWdcma0rRQ&oe=6A09C1F2"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "1576468597024644", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619588_1576468600357977_963030132674722656_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9HHrDL2q-3UQ7kNvwEQJCOp&_nc_oc=AdrwgHd-v_CXrt7ZRNY9__pVgedkeM27xX8M8NUHEt5Msg_MRs_4Dlkykuzc3wCibEU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6TEWOJEdhgOv6J1dxueAXygjo4DT7FG9pg8fVi0HMA3A&oe=6A09C838"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscap32_2560x1440_shoko.png", "id": "1450279846165373", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618065_1450279849498706_5641516501206576537_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ch-pePLNc-kQ7kNvwG9liEx&_nc_oc=AdrRzCZUUiyqXqgwohF2t0lG1uofSpKoaxtnO0Jc45prw-SApgne72ZKeB8ufRaYOAo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4gic8THPd3THQ-7uMrcYyyoJvx-qV3EVN86-0wHi5Mgw&oe=6A09E3DF"}, "display_name": "Street Simulator Z: Multiplayer", "keywords": ["Gang", "Survival", "Cooking", "Fight", "Gun"], "long_description": "\n Street Simulator Z: Multiplayer is the laugh-out-loud VR adventure where you and your friends (up to 4 players \u2013 insert player count) team up to flip your fortunes.\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\n{1105387631512705}\n\n\n Grow exotic herbs, cook up amazing (and maybe bizarre) dishes, take down any troublemakers who get in your way, and hustle your way from zero to hero.\n{1401990557573965}\n Earn serious cash, upgrade your gear, and show everyone who's truly running things! All in immersive Meta Quest VR.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\n\ud83e\udd1d SQUAD GOALS! HILARIOUS CO-OP MULTIPLAYER\n\n\u2694\ufe0f PAYBACK TIME! TAKE DOWN THOSE ANNOYING FOES\n\n\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf72 FROM HERB GARDEN TO GOURMET (OR NOT)! GROW, COOK, PROFIT!!!\n\n\ud83d\udcb0 RISE FROM RAGS TO RICHES! EARN BIG & LIVE LARGE\n\n   \n\nREADY TO STIR UP SOME TROUBLE (AND GET PAID FOR IT)?\n\nJump into Street Simulator Z: Multiplayer, call your squad, and start your wild journey from nobody to a notorious (and wealthy) legend!\n\n\n", "short_description": "Life in this town can be a drag, especially with all these annoying jerks causing trouble! "}]}, "developer_name": "Storay Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypo